@format 1
@id edit.save-plan
@title Save edit plan
@area Edit
@entry input
@summary Capture the active source's current Crop, tone, and skip state and persist it in the sidecar.
@flow TB
@related edit.restore-plan, edit.change-crop, edit.change-tone

@alias tab = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PEditTab
@alias edit = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LEdit

[input] Save request arrives <input>
- Receive a save request from an Edit-state event or source restoration @ tab.PEditPlanSave(...)
> guard

[guard] Check save target <decision>
- Suppress writes during restoration or without an active source @ tab.PEditPlanSave(...)
? "No writable active plan exists" > unchanged
? "Current plan can be saved" > persist

[persist] Store sidecar plan <storage>
- Read the current Crop, tone, and skip state for the active source @ tab.PEditPlanSave(...)
- Persist the active source's edit plan @ edit.LEditPlanSave(...)
- Propagate any enabled persistent settings to every listed source @ tab.PEditPersistentWrite(...)
> result

[result] Edit plan saved <output>
= The active source sidecar contains the current edit plan.

[unchanged] Save suppressed <output>
= No sidecar write occurs during restoration or without an active source.
